const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"综述梳理市场如何组织，以及制度结构如何影响交易与价格形成这一组经济问题。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"This survey organizes the economic questions raised by how markets are structured and how that structure affects trading and price formation. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它汇集市场微观结构研究，不是单一估计器的实证检验；交易制度和模型假设决定其组织的比较。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It is a survey of market-microstructure research rather than a single-estimator test; institutions and modeling assumptions determine the comparisons it brings together. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"若延伸其中被引用的结论，应回到对应研究所使用的交易场所规则、订单与报价字段、参与者定义、时钟精度及样本时期。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"A reader extending a cited result needs the specific venue rules, order and quote fields, participant definitions, clock precision, and source-period selection used by that underlying study. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"该综述提供机制和证据类别的地图，而非某个放之四海而皆准的流动性、信息或执行质量指标。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The survey provides a map of mechanisms and evidence categories, not one universal measure of liquidity, information, or execution quality. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"先定位被复现的原始研究；保留场所制度、订单类型、最小报价单位、成交分类，并区分报价、成交和持仓。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Identify the cited underlying study before reproducing any claim; preserve venue regime, order type, tick size, trade classification, and the distinction between quotes, trades, and positions. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Markets (2000)。综述不能把公开 OHLCV 变成订单簿或参与者数据，其框架也不构成交易建议或当前市场质量评价。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Markets (2000). A survey cannot make public OHLCV equivalent to order-book or participant data, and its framework is not a trading recommendation or a current market-quality assessment. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1386-4181(00)00007-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Markets (2000) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Market Microstructure: A Survey”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。综述不能把公开 OHLCV 变成订单簿或参与者数据，其框架也不构成交易建议或当前市场质量评价。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Market Microstructure: A Survey”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
